{"slug":"j-m-e","ar":"ج م ع","total":129,"core":"gathering","forms":[{"ar":"جَمِيع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":53,"gloss":"all, together","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":56,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِنَّا","لَجَمِيعٌ","حَـٰذِرُونَ"],"en":"And indeed, we are a cautious society"}},{"ar":"أَجْمَعِين","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":26,"gloss":"all, every one","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":92,"p":3,"ar":["فَوَرَبِّكَ","لَنَسْـَٔلَنَّهُمْ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"en":"So by your Lord, We will surely question them all"}},{"ar":"جَمَعَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":22,"gloss":"to gather","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":18,"p":1,"ar":["وَجَمَعَ","فَأَوْعَىٰٓ"],"en":"And collected [wealth] and hoarded"}},{"ar":"جَمْع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":13,"gloss":"gathering; host","word":null,"ex":{"s":100,"a":5,"p":3,"ar":["فَوَسَطْنَ","بِهِۦ","جَمْعًا"],"en":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively"}},{"ar":"أَجْمَعُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"to resolve, agree","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":64,"p":1,"ar":["فَأَجْمِعُوا۟","كَيْدَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","ٱئْتُوا۟","صَفًّا ۚ","وَقَدْ","أَفْلَحَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","مَنِ","ٱسْتَعْلَىٰ"],"en":"So resolve upon your plan and then come [forward] in line. And he has succeeded today who overcomes"}},{"ar":"جَامِع","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"The Gatherer","word":"al-jami","ex":{"s":3,"a":9,"p":3,"ar":["رَبَّنَآ","إِنَّكَ","جَامِعُ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لِيَوْمٍ","لَّا","رَيْبَ","فِيهِ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُخْلِفُ","ٱلْمِيعَادَ"],"en":"Our Lord, surely You will gather the people for a Day about which there is no doubt. Indeed, Allah does not fail in His promise"}},{"ar":"مَجْمَع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"meeting point, junction","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":61,"p":3,"ar":["فَلَمَّا","بَلَغَا","مَجْمَعَ","بَيْنِهِمَا","نَسِيَا","حُوتَهُمَا","فَٱتَّخَذَ","سَبِيلَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","سَرَبًا"],"en":"But when they reached the junction between them, they forgot their fish, and it took its course in